{"ref":"BDB, מַעֲרֶ֫כֶת","hw":"מַעֲרֶ֫כֶת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲרֶ֫כֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. row, line</strong>;—only of the rows of ‘shew’-bread; abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.7\">Lv 24:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲרָ֑כֶת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.6\">6</a> (P); elsewhere Chr: <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.32\">1 Ch 9:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.29\">23:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:34\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.34\">Ne 10:34</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֻׁלְחַן הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.18\">2 Ch 29:18</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.16\">1 Ch 28:16</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲרֶכֶת לֶחֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.11\">2 Ch 13:11</a> <em>the row of bread</em>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ תָּמִיד</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.3\">2:3</a> <em>the row of continuity</em>, bread continually present in rows; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁתַּיִם מַעֲרָכוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.6\">Lv 24:6</a>.","next":"BDB, ערל","prev":"BDB, מַעֲרָכָה"}